    "<div style="margin: 32px 0 12px; color: #49627f; font-size: .82em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em;">GET READY</div>\n",
    "<div style="padding:22px; border-radius:16px; background:#f7f9fc; border:1px solid #dce5f0;">\n",
    "<h2 style="margin:0 0 14px; color:#132744;">시작 전 체크</h2>\n",
    "<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">\n",
    "  <div style="padding:12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px;">🐍 <strong>Python 3.11+</strong><br><span style="color:#60758c; font-size:.9em;">가상환경으로 실행</span></div>\n",
    "  <div style="padding:12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px;">🔐 <strong>AI Core service key</strong><br><span style="color:#60758c; font-size:.9em;">.env에만 보관</span></div>\n",
    "  <div style="padding:12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:10px;">☁️ <strong>RUNNING deployment</strong><br><span style="color:#60758c; font-size:.9em;">LLM 호출 전 확인</span></div>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "<p style="margin:0 0 7px; color:#4b5f78;">의존성은 저장소 루트의 requirements.txt 하나로 관리합니다.</p>\n",
    "<div style="padding:12px 14px; border-radius:9px; color:#dcecff; background:#101f3a; font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.86em; overflow-x:auto;">macOS/Linux &nbsp; python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/python -m pip install --upgrade pip -r requirements.txt</div>\n",
    "<div style="margin-top:8px; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:9px; color:#dcecff; background:#101f3a; font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size:.86em; overflow-x:auto;">Windows PowerShell &nbsp; py -m venv .venv && .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install --upgrade pip -r requirements.txt</div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
